        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Aegers borg is a small town located in the fjords of scandinavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mayor of the town you need to prepare the village for the coming winters which are becoming more fierce as the years go by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay is to make sure their are enough resources to survive the winter, when the resources run out people will start to perish and eventually it will be game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no timer in the game, take your time to check what is most efficient to do each month</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >because during winter its to cold to gather resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mayor you have the following tasks</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign villagers to gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions which event to follow up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where to help</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to get the highest highscore like in the Arcade hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Aegers borg is a small town located in the fjords of scandinavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mayor of the town you need to prepare the village for the coming winters which are becoming more fierce as the years go by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay is to make sure their are enough resources to survive the winter, when the resources run out people will start to perish and eventually it will be game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no timer in the game, take your time to check what is most efficient to do each month</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >because during winter its to cold to gather resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mayor you have the following tasks</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign villagers to gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions which event to follow up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where to help</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal is to get the highest highscore like in the Arcade hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "short_description": "You are in charge of the village called &quot;Aegers Borg&quot; manage the village her resources through assigning villagers, resolving events or by completing special rituals, develop and prepare the village because &quot;winter is coming&quot;.",
